# --- Roblox builds -----------------------------------------------------------
# Place and model files are build OUTPUT (rojo build) -- the source of truth is src/ + the project
# file, so a committed build would otherwise only go stale and cause merge pain.
*.rbxl
*.rbxlx
*.rbxm
*.rbxmx

# ...with one deliberate exception: the project owner asked for a ready-to-open place file
# committed alongside the source, so it can be opened in Studio without running `rojo serve`.
# Rebuild it with `rojo build -o SanctumOfEmbers.rbxlx` after any change to src/.
!/SanctumOfEmbers.rbxlx

# Studio's lock files, written next to an open place.
*.lock

# --- Tooling output ----------------------------------------------------------
# The test bundle is regenerated by tests/tools/bundle.mjs on every run.
/.bundle/
sourcemap.json
/out
/build
/tests/out

# --- Node (tests/tools/bundle.mjs) -------------------------------------------
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Editors / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea
*.swp

# NOTE: rokit.toml is the pinned toolchain manifest and MUST stay committed.
